# Run 2026-10-31, boot A1 (superflat): recipe, tag, food and item rows through /zq (zz_zq_probe.js, prep_srv.sh
# copies it). zq output format: "<recipe id> -> <count> <result>", "makes <id>: N", "itemtag <tag> (N): ids",
# "food <id>: nutrition N, modifier M, effects [...]". Rows that need a count the probe cannot print end LOOK.
pace 2

## SQ-PS-05 | powdered sugar and batter recipes
> zq makes creativeengineering:powdered_sugar_bucket
> zq makes creativeengineering:powdered_sugar
> zq rdetail batter
expect vivacuumizing/powdered_sugar_bucket -> 1 creativeengineering:powdered_sugar_bucket
expect powdered_sugar_bucket_from_powder -> 1 creativeengineering:powdered_sugar_bucket
expect powdered_sugar_from_bucket -> 8 creativeengineering:powdered_sugar
expect mortar/sugar_powdered_sugar -> 4 creativeengineering:powdered_sugar
expect createmilling/sugar_powdered_sugar
expect createcrushing/sugar_powdered_sugar
reject tactical_fishing:fishing_creativeengineering_powdered_sugar_bucket
look rdetail: vacuum recipe takes bucket + 4 sugar; milling and crushing have a second result at 0.5; the three batter recipes list wheat flour, cornmeal and farmersdelight:rice in the grain slots

